add('b156','以掌子面擠出、玻纖筋黏結與開挖保留長度控制面補強~Control face reinforcement through extrusion, fibre-bar bond and retained length','玻纖筋是地層補強，不能把全部面壓簡單平均分配到每支筋。~Fibre bars reinforce ground; total face pressure cannot simply be divided among all bars.','同一 6000 mm 參考長度內，假想擠出由 12 增為 18 mm，平均變形比由 0.2% 增為 0.3%；不是每支筋的相同應變。~Over a 6000 mm reference length, extrusion rising from 12 to 18 mm changes the mean deformation ratio from 0.2% to 0.3%; this is not identical strain in every bar.',r'''
掌子面擠出與地層核心~Face extrusion and ground core§面前地層向開挖空間擠出會削弱拱效應，補強筋透過黏結抑制核心變形。量到的面位移包含開挖卸載與地層時效，不能直接當作每根筋伸長；應先定義量測參考長度及未擾動基準，再比較不同進尺的擠出增量。~Ground extruding toward the opening weakens arching, while bonded bars restrain the core. Face movement includes unloading and time effects rather than each bar's extension. Define reference length and an undisturbed datum before comparing extrusion increments at different excavation advances.§meanDeformationRatio=12 mm/6000 mm=0.002=0.2 percent§將多點面位移與開挖時間、距離及地層分區對時~Synchronize multipoint face movement with excavation time, distance and ground zones§基準也隨核心移動會低估擠出，錯判補強已奏效~A datum moving with the core understates extrusion and falsely indicates effective reinforcement§面位移除以長度就是每支玻纖筋的真實應變~Face movement divided by length equals the actual strain of every bar
補強密度與非均勻分擔~Reinforcement density and unequal sharing§每支筋對應的面積可描述幾何密度，卻不是固定承載分區。面中心、周邊及薄弱夾層的變形不同，黏結尚未動員的筋可能幾乎不受力；密度比較應同時看長度與岩土變形，避免只用根數評估面穩定。~Area per bar describes geometric density rather than a fixed load tributary. Centre, edge and weak-layer movements differ, and bars with unmobilized bond may carry little load. Compare density together with length and ground deformation instead of judging face stability from count alone.§tributaryArea=faceArea/barCount=80 m2/40=2 m2 per bar§比對筋位圖與面中心、邊緣及弱層的位移分布~Compare bar locations with displacement at the centre, edge and weak layers§均勻根數掩蓋弱層沒有有效補強，面局部仍持續擠出~Uniform counts conceal ineffective reinforcement of a weak layer with continuing local extrusion§面積除以筋數就能決定每支筋一定承受的荷載~Area divided by bar count determines the exact force in each bar
玻纖材料與脆性拉伸~Fibre material and brittle tension§玻纖複材沿纖維方向強度高，但橫向、彎曲及剪切性能不同，不能套用鋼材的屈服延性。接頭及表面肋形也影響有效承載，名義拉力應以材證與試驗方向配對；沒有明顯塑性警訊時，損傷辨識尤其依賴品質證據。~Fibre composites are strong along fibres but differ in transverse, bending and shear behaviour, so steel yielding assumptions do not apply. Connections and surface ribs affect effective resistance. Match certificates to test direction; limited plastic warning makes quality evidence particularly important.§Nt=A*ft=500 mm2*600 N/mm2=300000 N=300 kN§核對縱向拉伸試驗、接頭型式與安裝後表面損傷~Check longitudinal tension tests, connection type and installed surface damage§運送折傷造成局部纖維斷裂，外徑正常仍突然拉斷~Handling bends break local fibres and cause sudden rupture despite a normal diameter§玻纖筋能像鋼筋一樣先大幅屈服才破壞~A fibre bar yields extensively like steel before it fails
孔壁黏結與有效錨固~Bore-wall bond and effective anchorage§玻纖筋透過漿體將拉力分散到孔壁，實際界面受孔壁擾動及注漿連續性控制。長度增加不保證線性增加容量，受拉端先動員且可能先軟化；平均黏結公式只能用作初步量級，必須配合拉拔曲線辨認滑移位置。~Grout distributes bar force to the bore wall, controlled by disturbance and continuity. Longer embedment does not guarantee proportional capacity because the loaded end mobilizes and may soften first. An average-bond estimate provides scale and needs pull curves to identify the slipping interface.§N=pi*d*L*tau=pi*0.04 m*4 m*0.20 MPa=100.5 kN§以拉拔位移、灌漿量和孔壁條件共同判斷有效黏結~Assess effective bond using pull movement, grout volume and bore-wall condition§軟弱孔壁剪壞使筋連漿拔出，提高筋強度無法解決~A weak bore wall shears and releases bar with grout despite stronger reinforcement§只要玻纖筋本身夠強就不會發生拔出~A sufficiently strong fibre bar cannot pull out of the ground
開挖進尺與保留長度~Advance and retained reinforcement§每次開挖會切去靠近面的一段筋，剩餘錨固長度隨進尺降低。原始孔長合格不代表下一循環仍有足夠保留量，偏斜和孔底未填也會減少有效段；應建立每一輪補強與實際進尺的幾何帳，而非只記採購長度。~Each advance removes the near-face section, reducing retained anchorage. Correct original length does not guarantee the next cycle's effective embedment; deviation and unfilled ends reduce it further. Maintain a geometric record of each reinforcement round and actual advance rather than purchase length alone.§retainedLength=installedLength-advance=12 m-7 m=5 m§逐輪比較實測孔長、累積進尺及下一輪補強位置~Compare measured bore length, accumulated advance and the next reinforcement round§超進尺把有效黏結段切短，局部擠出突然加快~Excess advance shortens effective bond and abruptly accelerates local extrusion§一次安裝長筋就能不受限制地連續開挖~Installing long bars once permits unlimited continuous excavation
鑽孔偏差與地層覆蓋~Bore deviation and ground coverage§孔口布點均勻不能保證深部補強均勻，傾角誤差會讓孔群逐漸聚集或發散。弱層若位於原預期孔軸之外，筋數再多也不能提供所需拘束；需把三維孔軸與地質模型重疊，辨識未覆蓋體積而非只看正面照片。~Uniform collars do not ensure deep coverage because angular errors concentrate or separate bores. A weak layer outside the actual axes remains unrestrained despite a high bar count. Overlay three-dimensional axes and geology to identify unreinforced volumes rather than relying on a face photograph.§offset=10 m*tan(0.5 deg)=0.0873 m§以導向或孔內量測重建孔軸並疊合弱層位置~Reconstruct bore axes from guidance or downhole measurement and overlay weak layers§同向偏孔留下連續缺筋帶，正面布點卻完全合格~Consistently deviated bores leave a continuous unreinforced band despite correct collars§孔口位置正確就代表深部補強位置一定正確~Correct collar positions guarantee correct deep reinforcement positions
施工時間與黏結成熟~Construction time and bond maturity§漿體材料需要時間形成可用黏結，低溫或大量水流可能改變成熟速度。表面硬化不能證明深部界面已發展，下一次開挖若過早卸載會在尚弱的錨固中造成滑移；評估要使用與原位環境可比的試體或核准方法。~Grout needs time to develop useful bond, with cold or flowing water changing maturity. Surface hardening does not prove deep-interface development. Early unloading in the next advance can slip a weak anchorage, requiring specimens or approved evidence comparable to the installed environment.§strengthRatio=earlyBond/matureBond=0.08 MPa/0.20 MPa=0.40§將原位溫度、材料齡期及可比黏結試驗共同對照~Compare in-place temperature, age and representative bond tests§室內成熟資料高估低溫孔內黏結，導致早期滑移~Indoor maturity data overstate cold-bore bond and allow early slip§孔口漿體變硬就代表整支錨固已達最終強度~Hard grout at the collar proves final strength along the entire anchorage
多點擠出與變形梯度~Multipoint extrusion and gradients§掌子面單一中心位移只能描述一點，無法辨認深部剪切帶與整體剛體移動。沿深度的多點位移差可建立變形梯度，但標距跨越不同地層時必須分段；量測斷線也可能被誤讀成穩定，因此缺值要保留而非補成零。~One central displacement cannot distinguish a deep shear band from rigid movement. Differences along depth give deformation gradients but should be segmented across strata. A broken channel may also appear stable, so retain missing values rather than replacing them with zeros.§gradient=(18-6) mm/3000 mm=0.004=0.4 percent§比較深淺錨點相對位移及通道完整性診斷~Compare relative shallow-deep movement and channel-integrity diagnostics§深部滑移集中在短區段，平均面位移卻顯得溫和~Deep slip localizes within a short zone despite modest mean face movement§掌子面中心位移小就代表整個核心沒有剪切~Small central face movement proves the entire core is free of shear
切除材料與施工介面~Cuttable material and excavation interfaces§玻纖筋可被開挖設備切除的特性，不表示其碎片或殘端對後續流程沒有影響。材料碎屑可能混入土石與排水系統，殘留筋端也會改變局部接觸；交接須把設計保留段和施工切除段分開，避免把已移除材料仍算入支護。~Cuttable reinforcement still affects downstream work through fragments and residual ends. Debris can enter spoil or drainage systems, while remnants alter contact. Distinguish retained design lengths from removed sections so excavation records do not continue crediting reinforcement that no longer exists.§removedBarLength=barCount*advance=40*1.5 m=60 m per assumed cycle§按循環核對切除長度、殘端位置及排水清理紀錄~Audit removed length, remnant positions and drainage-cleaning records by cycle§資料庫未扣除切去段而高估面前剩餘補強能力~A database retaining removed lengths overstates remaining reinforcement ahead of the face§可切削材料被挖掉後仍可算入原先支護容量~Excavated cuttable material can still be counted in original support capacity
面補強與周邊支護協調~Face reinforcement and peripheral support§面補強抑制核心擠出，周邊初支則限制徑向收斂，兩者作用不同又相互影響。只增加面筋不能補償基腳沉陷或未閉合環，監測應同時追蹤面前與面後；施工判讀須避免把周邊支護問題錯歸因於筋材品質。~Face bars restrain extrusion while peripheral support limits radial convergence; the mechanisms differ but interact. More face bars cannot compensate for sinking feet or an unclosed ring. Monitor ahead and behind the face to avoid attributing peripheral-support problems solely to bar quality.§movementRatio=faceExtrusion/crownSettlement=15 mm/5 mm=3, a diagnostic ratio only§同步比較面擠出、拱頂沉陷及初支閉合位置~Compare extrusion, crown settlement and initial-support closure position simultaneously§面位移改善卻周邊持續收斂，單一指標掩蓋另一失效~Improved face movement conceals continuing perimeter convergence when only one indicator is used§掌子面位移受控就能證明所有周邊支護都安全~Controlled face movement proves every peripheral support element is safe
''')

add('b157','以水壓邊界、焊縫與分區連續性驗證隧道防水膜~Verify tunnel membranes through pressure boundaries, seams and compartment continuity','防水膜阻隔滲水，承壓與排水責任仍須由整體襯砌系統承擔。~The membrane blocks seepage, while the lining system must carry pressure or provide drainage.','水頭由 20 增為 30 m 時，淡水壓力由 196.2 增為 294.3 kPa；膜後排水堵塞的水頭須與結構模型一致。~Raising freshwater head from 20 to 30 m increases pressure from 196.2 to 294.3 kPa; a blocked-drain head must agree with the structural model.',r'''
水頭與結構承壓邊界~Head and structural pressure boundary§防水膜本身不會讓地下水壓消失，封閉系統需要襯砌承受相應壓力，排水系統則依可靠排導降低水頭。將排水型和承壓型細部混用會留下不明荷載；必須明確寫出正常、堵塞和維修狀態的水壓邊界。~A membrane does not eliminate groundwater pressure: a closed system transfers pressure to lining, while a drained system relies on discharge to reduce head. Mixing the two concepts leaves undefined loads. Define pressure boundaries for normal operation, blockage and maintenance states.§p=rho*g*h=1000 kg/m3*9.81 m/s2*20 m=196200 Pa=196.2 kPa§對照地下水位、膜後水壓及排水通路的實際連接~Compare groundwater level, behind-membrane pressure and actual drain connections§排水堵塞卻仍沿用低水頭設計，使襯砌承受未檢核壓力~Blocked drains leave lining exposed to pressure omitted by a low-head assumption§只要有防水膜地下水壓就不會作用在襯砌~A waterproof membrane prevents groundwater pressure from acting on the lining
基面平整與膜材跨空~Substrate smoothness and membrane bridging§尖突和凹穴使膜材在混凝土擠壓下局部拉伸或刺穿，名義厚度不能補救不相容基面。柔軟墊層分散接觸但也可能壓縮，膜跨越空洞時的拉伸與支承條件不同；基面幾何應在被覆前留下可追溯紀錄。~Projections and hollows stretch or puncture membrane under concrete pressure; nominal thickness cannot cure an incompatible substrate. Cushioning spreads contact but can compress, while bridging a cavity changes restraint. Record substrate geometry before it is concealed by the membrane.§localExtension=(105-100) mm/100 mm=0.05=5 percent§以輪廓量測與接觸樣板標示尖突、凹穴及墊層位置~Map projections, hollows and cushioning using profile measurements and contact templates§膜材被混凝土壓入凹穴而局部拉裂，表面原本看似平順~Concrete pushes membrane into a hollow and tears it despite a previously smooth appearance§膜材延伸率高就能容許任意尖突基面~High membrane elongation permits a substrate with any sharp projections
膜材厚度與批次差異~Membrane thickness and batch differences§膜厚是耐穿刺與加工品質的一部分，性能還取決於配方、老化及焊接相容性。局部薄區可能沿捲材邊緣或摺痕出現，平均厚度合格不代表最薄點合格；不同批次材料的接合需證明相容，不能只憑顏色辨認。~Thickness contributes to puncture resistance and quality, while formulation, ageing and weld compatibility also matter. Thin zones may occur near edges or folds despite a passing mean. Demonstrate compatibility between batches rather than identifying material from colour alone.§thicknessRatio=minimum/nominal=1.6 mm/2.0 mm=0.80§分區量測厚度並追溯捲材批號、接縫和摺痕位置~Map thickness by roll batch, seam and fold position§局部薄點在後續施工受壓破裂，平均報告未能預警~A locally thin point tears under later construction pressure despite a passing average report§捲材平均厚度合格就能忽略局部薄點~Passing mean roll thickness permits local thin points to be ignored
焊縫有效寬度與剝離~Effective seam width and peeling§焊縫需要連續熔合，外觀寬度不等於有效黏合寬度，污染或皺摺可能形成未熔合通道。剝離與剪切試驗檢查不同受力方式，單一峰值需搭配破壞位置；以完整材料撕裂還是界面分離，會導出不同品質判讀。~A seam needs continuous fusion; visible width differs from effective bonded width when contamination or folds create channels. Peel and shear test different loading modes. Interpret peak force together with whether failure tears parent material or separates the interface.§lineResistance=F/width=300 N/50 mm=6 N/mm§將剝離與剪切結果配對焊縫破壞面及有效寬度~Pair peel and shear results with failure faces and effective seam width§表面封口掩蓋內部未熔合通道，水沿接縫串流~Surface closure conceals an unfused internal channel that carries water along the seam§焊縫外觀平滑就能證明全寬熔合~A smooth seam appearance proves fusion across its entire width
雙焊道試驗與溫度修正~Dual-seam tests and temperature effects§雙焊道中間的封閉通道可提供連續性檢核，但氣壓隨溫度改變，壓降不全代表漏氣。測試區段端部封閉與儀器接頭也可能洩漏，必須與焊縫本體分開；使用絕對壓力與絕對溫度才能作理想氣體比較。~A closed channel between dual seams tests continuity, but pressure varies with temperature and not every drop is leakage. End closures and instrument fittings can leak separately from the seam. Ideal-gas comparison requires absolute pressure and absolute temperature rather than gauge values alone.§P2=P1*T2/T1=300 kPa absolute*288 K/293 K=294.9 kPa absolute§同步記錄通道絕對壓力、溫度及端封接頭檢漏結果~Record absolute channel pressure, temperature and end-fitting leak checks together§冷卻造成壓降被誤判為焊縫漏氣，引出無效重焊~Cooling-induced pressure loss is mistaken for a leaking seam and prompts ineffective rewelding§任何試壓壓降都能直接證明膜材有破洞~Every pressure-test drop directly proves a hole in the membrane
分區止水與水路隔離~Compartments and hydraulic isolation§分區系統限制漏水在膜後蔓延，水擋、接頭與後續修復管路必須構成連續邊界。圖上分區不等於實體隔離，跨區穿孔或未連接止水帶可讓一處破損影響很大範圍；驗證要追蹤水路而不只是統計隔板數。~Compartments limit migration behind the membrane through continuous waterstops, joints and repair interfaces. Drawn zones are not physical isolation: penetrations or disconnected stops can spread one defect widely. Verification therefore traces hydraulic paths rather than counting compartment boundaries.§affectedAreaRatio=oneZone/wholeArea=100 m2/1000 m2=0.10, assuming intact isolation§逐一核對分區水擋交會、穿透細部及可追溯測試端口~Audit waterstop intersections, penetrations and traceable test ports by compartment§一處跨區缺口讓多區連通，局部維修失去定位能力~One cross-zone gap connects compartments and defeats localization of repair§圖紙畫成多個分區就能保證實際水路隔離~Multiple compartments drawn on a plan guarantee hydraulic isolation in place
穿透構件與接縫變形~Penetrations and joint movement§支架、預埋件和施工接縫會中斷連續膜面，局部位移常集中在固定點附近。密封細部需要同時容許預期移動並保持水路連續，不能把材料拉伸率直接當作接頭允許位移；自由長度、固定方式及多方向變形都要確認。~Brackets, embedded items and joints interrupt membrane continuity and concentrate movement near fixings. Details must accommodate movement while preserving water isolation. Material elongation is not the joint movement allowance: free length, restraint and multidirectional deformation require separate verification.§nominalStrain=movement/freeLength=5 mm/100 mm=0.05=5 percent§比較接頭位移方向、膜材自由長度及穿透處試件變形~Compare joint movement directions, membrane free length and penetration-specimen response§固定點太靠近接縫使小位移集中成撕裂~Fixings too close to a joint concentrate small movement into tearing§材料斷裂延伸率就是所有穿透細部的允許位移~Material break elongation is the allowable movement of every penetration detail
隱蔽前損傷與後續工序~Pre-concealment damage and subsequent work§焊縫檢驗後的膜材仍可能被鋼筋、墊塊或台車碰傷，檢查時間因而決定證據有效範圍。修補片會新增邊界與搭接，必須索引到原缺陷位置；最後隱蔽前檢查應覆蓋後續施工造成的損傷，而非重複舊報告。~Membranes can be damaged by reinforcement, spacers or carriages after seam testing, so inspection timing defines evidence validity. Patches add new boundaries and overlaps and must trace back to defects. Final pre-cover inspection must address damage from subsequent work rather than merely repeat an earlier report.§recheckCoverage=areasAfterLastTrade/totalAreas=18/20=90 percent§將膜材照片、修補編號與最後一道交叉工序完成時間連結~Link membrane photographs and patch IDs to completion of the final crossing trade§檢驗後被鋼筋刺穿，舊合格紀錄無法代表隱蔽時狀態~Reinforcement punctures a previously tested membrane and invalidates its earlier passing record§焊接檢驗完成後就永遠不需再次查看膜面~After seam inspection the membrane surface never needs another check
漏水定位與表面假象~Leak localization and surface symptoms§隧道內出水位置未必位於膜材破損處，水可能沿膜後、接縫或空腔移動。只封住可見出口會改變水路，甚至提高局部壓力；診斷需整合分區圖、排水量及時間變化，區分新缺陷、既有連通與排水阻塞。~The interior discharge location need not coincide with membrane damage because water migrates behind layers and through joints or cavities. Sealing an outlet redirects paths and may raise local pressure. Combine compartment maps, flow and timing to distinguish new damage, connectivity and blocked drains.§leakRate=collectedVolume/time=6 L/20 min=0.30 L/min§將出水位置、分區端口反應與水位變化共同繪圖~Map discharge, compartment-port responses and groundwater changes together§出口被封後轉移到鄰區，原來的膜破損仍未修復~A sealed outlet moves to a neighbouring area while the original membrane defect remains§內表面漏水位置一定就是膜材破損的位置~An interior leak always marks the exact location of membrane damage
耐久相容與維護交接~Durability compatibility and handover§防水膜與修補材料的相容性可能受塑化劑、溫度和地下水化學影響，短期黏著良好不能保證長期功能。交接應保存原材料、焊接及分區資料，讓未來修繕能確認材料搭配；未知材料直接覆貼可能使原系統更難診斷。~Compatibility with repair materials can depend on plasticizers, temperature and groundwater chemistry; initial adhesion does not establish durability. Retain material, welding and compartment records for future selection. Overlaying unknown materials can make the original system harder to diagnose and maintain.§recordCompleteness=linkedRolls/installedRolls=48/50=96 percent§核對材料批次、相容性證據、分區圖與修補履歷~Audit batches, compatibility evidence, compartment maps and patch histories§失去材料身分後採不相容修補，造成界面劣化和再漏~Lost material identity leads to incompatible repair, interface degradation and renewed leakage§短期貼得牢就代表修補材料能長期相容~Strong initial adhesion proves long-term compatibility of repair materials
''')
add('b158','協調台車定位、新拌混凝土壓力與襯砌成形證據~Coordinate carriage position, fresh-concrete pressure and lining geometry evidence','台車是施工階段構造，完成面淨空與結構厚度必須同時檢核。~The carriage is a temporary structure; final clearance and structural thickness need simultaneous checks.','外半徑 5.30 m 固定，台車內半徑由 5.00 增為 5.05 m，襯砌厚度由 0.30 降為 0.25 m，減少 16.7%；淨空增加會消耗結構厚度。~At a fixed outer radius of 5.30 m, increasing form radius from 5.00 to 5.05 m reduces thickness from 0.30 to 0.25 m, by 16.7%; increased clearance consumes structural thickness.',r'''
淨空與襯砌厚度~Clearance and lining thickness§台車定位同時決定內表面淨空與可用混凝土厚度，向外調整並非只有好處。初支輪廓不規則時，平均半徑合格仍可能局部不足；定位需把軌道基準、台車形狀與初支點雲配準，辨認真正最薄區而非只測拱頂高度。~Carriage positioning sets both clearance and available concrete thickness, so moving outward is not purely beneficial. An irregular initial lining can leave thin zones despite a correct mean radius. Register track control, form geometry and initial-lining clouds to identify local minima rather than crown height alone.§thickness=outerRadius-innerRadius=5.30 m-5.00 m=0.30 m§把初支與模板點雲對齊到同一控制網並搜尋最小間距~Register support and form clouds to one network and locate minimum separation§台車偏心增加一側淨空卻壓縮另一側結構厚度~Carriage eccentricity increases clearance on one side while consuming thickness on the other§內部淨空越大就表示襯砌品質越好~Greater interior clearance always means better lining quality
新拌混凝土側壓~Fresh-concrete lateral pressure§新拌混凝土在凝結前會對模板產生側壓，壓力分布取決於流變、齡期和施工歷程。液體靜壓只是參考上界情境，不能把長期硬化混凝土當作同樣材料；模板、支架和地基應沿完整路徑傳遞這段短期作用。~Fresh concrete loads forms before setting, with pressure governed by rheology, age and placement history. Hydrostatic pressure is a reference scenario rather than hardened-concrete behaviour. Forms, frames and foundations must transfer this temporary action through a complete load path.§p=gamma*h=24 kN/m3*3 m=72 kPa§量測模板壓力並對照混凝土溫度、齡期及填充高度~Compare form pressures with concrete temperature, age and fill height§誤用已凝結假設低估側壓，模板鼓脹造成輪廓失真~An assumed set state understates pressure and allows forms to bulge out of profile§混凝土強度高就代表施工側壓一定比較小~High concrete strength guarantees lower pressure during placement
面板跨距與撓度~Panel span and deflection§面板在肋材間彎曲，支承間距對變形極敏感；相同均布線荷載作用於較大未支承跨距，會增加局部鼓出。簡支條帶的跨度四次方關係須保持線荷載 q、EI 與支承條件不變；固定總力不是同一假設。實際板還有雙向剛度與接頭，不能只靠平均模板厚度判斷。~Panels bend between ribs and are highly sensitive to support spacing. The same uniform line load over a longer unsupported span increases bulging. Fourth-power span scaling requires unchanged line load q, EI and support conditions; fixed total force is a different assumption. Actual panels add two-way action and joints beyond mean plate thickness.§deflectionRatio=(newSpan/oldSpan)^4=(1.1/1.0)^4=1.4641 for unchanged uniform line load q, EI and simple-support conditions§比較肋距、面板中心位移與接縫兩側的高差~Compare rib spacing, panel-centre displacement and steps across seams§局部缺肋讓面板撓度增加，形成難以修正的襯砌凹凸~A missing rib increases local deflection and creates permanent lining irregularity§模板厚度一致就能保證每一位置撓度一致~Uniform form thickness guarantees uniform deflection at every position
支架反力與地基承壓~Frame reactions and foundation bearing§模板荷載經支架傳到支腳或軌道，偏心填充可能讓某些支腳先受力或局部抬起。總重量平均分配只適用理想對稱，基底柔度會重新分配反力；檢查應同時包含支架力、接觸狀態及基準沉陷。~Form loads reach feet or rails through the frame, while asymmetric filling can load some feet first or lift others. Equal distribution assumes symmetry; foundation compliance redistributes reactions. Verify frame forces, contact status and datum settlement together rather than total weight alone.§bearingPressure=footReaction/area=360 kN/0.60 m2=600 kPa§將支腳荷重、底板接觸與軌道水準同步比較~Compare foot loads, bearing contact and rail levels on a common time base§一支腳沉陷讓相鄰支架超載，台車整體產生扭曲~One settling foot overloads neighbouring supports and twists the carriage§總重量除以支腳數就能得到每腳實際反力~Total weight divided by foot count gives each actual reaction
不對稱壓力與上浮~Asymmetric pressure and uplift§混凝土壓力作用在模板不同方向，垂直分量可能產生上浮，水平不平衡則推動台車。只核對自重不能證明穩定，約束位置與反力容量必須配合實際載入階段；局部脫離支腳後，原先線性分配也會改變。~Pressure acts in different directions, generating uplift or lateral imbalance. Self-weight alone does not establish stability; restraint positions and reactions must match the stage. Once a foot separates, the assumed linear distribution changes and requires a revised contact model.§uplift=p*A=80 kPa*8 m2=640 kN for an assumed projected area§比較台車垂直位移、支腳接觸和約束荷重歷程~Compare vertical carriage motion, foot contact and restraint-force histories§壓力不平衡抬起一側，使模板接縫張開與漏漿~Unbalanced pressure lifts one side, opening form joints and releasing grout§台車很重就不可能受到混凝土壓力抬升~A heavy carriage cannot be lifted by concrete pressure
拱頂填充與空洞~Crown filling and voids§拱頂是氣體與未填滿空間容易聚集的位置，出料量足夠不代表所有高點密實。理論體積與送入量的差也包含管路殘留、超挖和漏漿，不能直接等同空洞；應以多種證據區分幾何偏差與真正未填區。~Air and unfilled space collect at high points; adequate delivery does not prove a dense crown. Theoretical-versus-delivered volume also includes line residue, overbreak and leakage. Combine evidence to distinguish geometric differences from actual voids instead of treating the balance residual as a direct void measurement.§Inputs outerRadius=5.30 m, innerRadius=5.00 m, length=10 m; fullRingVolume=pi*(5.30^2-5.00^2)*10=97.08 m3, idealized full circular ring§對照材料收支、拱頂檢測與可取得的孔內或雷達證據~Compare material balance with crown checks and available borehole or radar evidence§拱頂空洞削弱接觸並集中彎曲，外表平順仍可能漏判~A crown void weakens contact and concentrates bending despite a smooth interior§混凝土總用量達到理論值就證明沒有空洞~Delivered concrete equal to theoretical volume proves there are no voids
早齡拆模與支承轉換~Early stripping and support transfer§拆模把混凝土自重及外力轉交給尚在硬化的襯砌，試件強度要能代表現地齡期與溫度。強度之外還有模數、裂縫及接觸條件，單一抗壓值不能證明整環穩定；支承轉換應明確納入施工階段模型。~Stripping transfers self-weight and external actions to hardening lining, so specimens must represent in-place age and temperature. Modulus, cracks and contact matter as well as compression strength. One strength value cannot establish ring stability; model the support transition explicitly.§stressRatio=assumedDemand/earlyStrength=1.5 MPa/6 MPa=0.25§將原位成熟度、可比試件及拆模後裂縫觀察配對~Pair in-place maturity and representative specimens with post-stripping crack observations§暖室試件高估現地強度，支承撤除後形成早齡裂紋~Warm specimens overstate field strength and early cracks form after support removal§早齡抗壓比值低就能取代所有拆模階段檢核~A low early compression ratio replaces every stripping-stage check
溫度收縮與約束裂縫~Thermal contraction and restrained cracking§水化升溫後的降溫使襯砌收縮，初支、底部或相鄰段可能限制其自由變形。完全約束公式只是一個上限模型，徐變與接觸滑移會降低應力；監測需把溫度梯度與整體降溫分開，避免將所有裂縫都歸因於強度不足。~Cooling after hydration contracts lining against restraint from initial support, the base or adjacent pours. Full restraint is an upper-bound model reduced by creep and slip. Separate thermal gradients from bulk cooling instead of attributing every crack to low strength.§freeStrain=alpha*dT=1e-5/K*20 K=0.0002; fullRestraintStress=20 GPa*0.0002=4 MPa§同步量測核心與表面溫度、應變及裂縫出現時刻~Synchronize core and surface temperatures, strain and crack-onset times§只看最高溫度漏掉降溫約束，延後才發現貫通裂縫~Peak-temperature checks miss cooling restraint and through-cracks are discovered late§混凝土不再升溫後就不會發生溫度裂縫~Thermal cracking cannot occur once concrete stops heating
施工縫對接與止水連續~Construction joints and waterstop continuity§台車循環形成分段施工縫，接縫需要在幾何、剪力與止水三方面連續。止水帶偏位可能在澆置後被完全遮蔽，外表縫線整齊也無法證明埋入長度；前後兩段資料應共同索引到同一接縫編號。~Carriage cycles create joints requiring geometric, shear and hydraulic continuity. A displaced waterstop becomes concealed after casting, and a neat visible line does not establish embedment. Index records from both adjacent pours to the same joint identifier.§embedmentImbalance=left-right=110 mm-70 mm=40 mm§檢查止水帶位置、固定狀態及兩段施工前後影像~Check waterstop position, restraint and images before and after both pours§止水帶偏折形成漏水捷徑，表面接縫看不出缺陷~A folded waterstop creates a leakage shortcut invisible at the surface joint§接縫外表平整就能保證內部止水帶位置正確~A flush surface joint guarantees the internal waterstop is correctly located
台車循環與品質追溯~Carriage cycles and quality traceability§同一台車會重複移動、調整和受載，螺接鬆動或幾何漂移可能逐循環累積。出廠合格只描述初始設備，不代表每次定位正確；交接須把台車版本、定位檢查與各襯砌段的材料和缺陷關聯，讓系統性偏差可被辨認。~Repeated moves, adjustments and loads accumulate loosened connections and geometric drift. Factory acceptance describes initial equipment rather than each setup. Link carriage revisions and positioning checks to lining batches and defects so systematic errors can be recognized across cycles.§driftPerCycle=totalDrift/cycles=12 mm/6=2 mm per cycle§用每循環定位殘差與設備檢查紀錄分析累積偏差~Analyze accumulated setup residuals alongside equipment inspection records§持續小偏位在多循環後侵入淨空，單次目視卻未察覺~Small repeated offsets eventually encroach on clearance while individual visual checks miss them§台車出廠合格就不需要每循環重新定位檢查~Factory-approved carriages never need positioning checks during later cycles
''')

add('b159','以閉合環、接頭相容與基底反力解析隧道仰拱~Analyze tunnel inverts through ring closure, joint compatibility and base reactions','完整環公式不能直接套用在未閉合、接頭鬆動或基底懸空狀態。~An intact-ring formula does not describe unclosed rings, loose joints or unsupported bases.','半徑 4 m 固定，壓力由 0.15 增為 0.18 MPa，理想環力由 0.60 增為 0.72 MN/m；這不含接頭彎矩和基底不均勻反力。~At a fixed 4 m radius, raising pressure from 0.15 to 0.18 MPa increases ideal-ring thrust from 0.60 to 0.72 MN/m, excluding joint moments and uneven base reactions.',r'''
閉合環與環向力~Ring closure and hoop force§拱部與仰拱接成閉合環後，部分地層作用可由環向壓力傳遞，開口環則更依賴拱腳反力與彎曲。閉合不是外觀接觸而已，接頭必須能傳遞所需作用；模型應保留閉合前已發生的變形，不能把全部荷載重新從零分配。~Closure allows ground actions to transfer partly through hoop compression, whereas an open arch relies more on foot reaction and bending. Visible contact is not sufficient joint transfer. Retain preclosure deformation rather than reallocating the complete load from an artificial zero state.§N=p*R=0.15 MPa*4 m=0.60 MN/m§比較閉合前後拱腳位移、仰拱應變及接頭狀態~Compare foot movement, invert strain and joint condition before and after closure§接頭未傳力卻採完整環模型，低估拱腳張開與彎曲~An intact-ring model with inactive joints understates foot spreading and bending§混凝土外觀連成一圈就等於受力環已完全閉合~Concrete appearing as a circle proves complete structural ring closure
仰拱曲率與力線~Invert curvature and force trajectory§仰拱曲率影響軸力作用線與基底接觸，過度平坦可能增加彎曲需求。局部厚度和曲率誤差互相影響，不能只量最低點高程；應將設計曲線與完成面配準，辨認轉折、接頭及基底鬆動造成的非均勻受力。~Invert curvature governs the thrust trajectory and base contact, and flattening can increase bending demand. Thickness and curvature errors interact, so the lowest elevation alone is insufficient. Register the completed profile to identify kinks, joints and uneven loading from disturbed ground.§eccentricMoment=N*e=600 kN/m*0.03 m=18 kNm/m§以斷面掃描檢核曲率、厚度與接頭附近的幾何轉折~Use section scans to check curvature, thickness and geometric kinks near joints§局部平坦區使力線偏心，形成表面與背面的交替裂紋~A locally flat zone shifts the thrust line and causes alternating-face cracks§仰拱最低點高程正確就代表整條曲線都正確~Correct lowest invert elevation proves the entire profile is correct
拱腳接頭與剪力傳遞~Foot joints and shear transfer§拱腳接頭把拱部作用帶入仰拱，粗糙面、鋼筋與混凝土接觸共同決定傳力。界面有泥膜或空隙時，名義面積不能全數參與；剪力模型須區分摩擦、黏結及鋼筋作用，並考慮正向力在施工階段可能改變。~Foot joints transfer arch action through interface roughness, reinforcement and contact. Mud films or gaps prevent the full nominal area engaging. Separate friction, cohesion and reinforcement mechanisms and recognize that normal force changes during construction rather than remaining permanently clamped.§frictionResistance=mu*N=0.5*400 kN=200 kN, neglecting other mechanisms§查核接面清理、鋼筋連續及接頭滑移量測~Check interface preparation, reinforcement continuity and measured joint slip§泥膜讓摩擦與黏結降低，仰拱形成局部滑移縫~A mud film reduces friction and bond and creates a localized sliding joint§接頭面積夠大就可以忽略界面污染~Large joint area permits interface contamination to be ignored
基底擾動與承壓~Base disturbance and bearing§開挖底部可能因積水、車輛或卸載而擾動，名義岩盤不一定仍有原來剛度。仰拱與基底需保持預期接觸，空隙會把連續反力變成局部支點；以平均壓力檢核時仍須另查最小接觸面積及可壓縮夾層。~Water, traffic and unloading disturb the base, so nominal rock need not retain its original stiffness. Gaps convert distributed support into local bearings. Mean-pressure checks therefore need separate evidence for minimum contact and compressible seams rather than assuming an undisturbed continuous foundation.§q=load/contactArea=1200 kN/6 m2=200 kPa§核對基底地質、水軟化區及仰拱下接觸證據~Check base geology, water-softened zones and evidence of invert contact§軟弱夾層壓密使仰拱差異沉陷並拉開接頭~A compressible seam settles unevenly and opens invert joints§基底被稱為岩盤就不可能發生可觀沉陷~A base classified as rock cannot undergo significant settlement
閉合距離與時間效應~Closure distance and time effects§掌子面到閉合位置的距離控制地層處於開口環狀態的長度，但相同距離在不同進尺速度下代表不同等待時間。地層有時效時，距離與時間都影響收斂；不能將一個工程的閉合距離直接當作所有地層的通用標準。~Face-to-closure distance controls the length remaining as an open ring, but equal distances imply different waiting times at different advance rates. Time-dependent ground requires both measures. A closure distance from one project is not a universal criterion for every ground condition.§waitingTime=distance/rate=12 m/(3 m/day)=4 day§將閉合位置、進尺速度及收斂速率放在共同時間軸~Align closure location, advance rate and convergence rate on a common timeline§進尺變慢但距離不變，等待時間增加而收斂持續累積~Slower advance increases waiting time and accumulated convergence at unchanged distance§閉合距離相同就代表所有施工時間效應相同~Equal closure distances imply identical construction-time effects
施工車輛與早齡載入~Construction traffic and early loading§仰拱完成後可能很快承受施工車輛，輪載屬局部作用而非均勻環壓。早齡混凝土、回填保護層與基底一起決定應力分散，單靠成熟混凝土強度不能代表當天狀態；應將短期交通荷載列入獨立階段。~Construction traffic may reach an invert soon after casting, applying local wheel actions rather than uniform ring pressure. Young concrete, cover fill and ground control load spread. Mature strength does not represent the day of loading, so treat traffic as a separate temporary stage.§contactPressure=wheelLoad/contactArea=60 kN/0.12 m2=500 kPa§比較車輛荷載、保護層厚度與當日混凝土成熟證據~Compare vehicle loads and cover depth with concrete maturity on the loading day§保護層不足使局部早齡裂損被後續回填遮住~Insufficient cover creates early local cracks that later fill conceals§仰拱外觀已硬化就能承受任何施工車輛~An apparently hard invert can carry any construction vehicle
地下水浮力與排水狀態~Groundwater uplift and drainage state§底部水頭可向上作用，排水可靠性決定是否能維持設計假設。自重、結構連接與地層反力必須在同一自由體中比較，不能把同一份摩擦或覆重重複計入；排水堵塞情境通常需要另建荷載組合。~Water head acts upward and drainage reliability determines whether the assumed condition persists. Compare weight, connections and ground reactions in one free body without double-counting friction or overburden. A blocked-drain state generally needs its own loading combination and contact assessment.§Inputs rho=1000 kg/m3, g=9.81 m/s2, h=5 m, A=10 m2; uplift=rho*g*h*A=1000*9.81*5*10=490500 N=490.5 kN§同步查看底部水壓、集水流量及仰拱垂直位移~Compare base pressure, collection flow and vertical invert movement simultaneously§排水堵塞讓底壓升高，原先穩定仰拱出現抬升~Blocked drainage raises base pressure and lifts an otherwise stable invert§隧道內沒有積水就代表仰拱底部沒有水壓~A dry tunnel interior proves there is no water pressure below the invert
收斂閉合與儀器對時~Convergence closure and synchronization§閉合前後的監測差異同時受開挖位置、溫度與儀器基準影響，不能只把曲線轉折歸因於仰拱生效。多方向收斂可分辨拱腳靠近、底部抬升和整體沉陷；讀值須保留量測弦長與基準更換歷史。~Changes across closure also reflect face position, temperature and datums, not just invert engagement. Multidirectional convergence distinguishes foot movement, base heave and overall settlement. Preserve chord lengths and reference changes so a curve break is not automatically interpreted as structural improvement.§closureStrain=chordChange/originalChord=4 mm/8000 mm=0.0005§把水平與斜向收斂、底部高程及閉合時刻共同配準~Register horizontal and diagonal convergence, base elevation and closure time§更換基準造成曲線跳動，被誤認為閉合後突然穩定~A reference change creates a curve jump mistaken for sudden postclosure stability§閉合後監測曲線變平就一定是結構已穩定~A flatter curve after closure necessarily proves structural stability
接縫漏水與耐久~Joint leakage and durability§仰拱接縫接近積水和沉積物，漏水可能沿施工界面連通到兩側。水量增加不一定表示裂縫擴大，也可能是水頭上升或排水改道；維修前應把接縫開口、化學環境與排水歷史配對，避免堵住唯一的洩壓通路。~Invert joints encounter water and sediment, and leakage can spread along construction interfaces. Increasing flow may reflect head rise or rerouting rather than wider cracks. Pair opening, chemistry and drainage history before repair to avoid sealing the only pressure-relief path.§leakChange=(0.6-0.2) L/min=0.4 L/min, at unspecified head requires further diagnosis§對照接縫開口、水頭及同區排水量的同步紀錄~Compare synchronized joint opening, head and local drainage flow§只封出水口使底壓升高，漏水轉移到鄰近接縫~Sealing an outlet raises base pressure and moves leakage to another joint§接縫漏水增加一定代表結構裂縫變大~Increasing joint leakage always means a structural crack has widened
永久環與維護交接~Permanent ring and maintenance handover§施工仰拱、填充層和永久路面可能同時存在，卻有不同承載與排水角色。維修開槽若誤切結構仰拱，會破壞環向傳力，原圖未標高程時尤其難辨認；交接應提供可追溯的分層幾何及禁止任意切割的結構界面。~Structural invert, fill and pavement have different loading and drainage roles despite sharing the same section. Maintenance cuts into the structural invert interrupt ring transfer, particularly where layer levels are unclear. Handover must preserve layered geometry and identify structural interfaces requiring engineering review.§availableNonstructuralDepth=coverDepth-uncertainty=0.40 m-0.05 m=0.35 m, not excavation permission§將竣工分層高程、排水位置與結構接頭編入維護圖~Record as-built layer levels, drain locations and structural joints in maintenance drawings§把結構仰拱當填充層開槽，切斷原本閉合的受力環~Treating structural invert as fill and cutting it interrupts the closed load path§隧道路面以下的混凝土都可以視為非結構填充~All concrete beneath a tunnel pavement can be treated as nonstructural fill
''')

add('b160','用能量、變形與監測不確定度辨識岩爆支護需求~Assess rockburst support using energy, deformation and monitoring uncertainty','靜態強度、動態吸能及事件預警是不同證據，不可互相替代。~Static strength, dynamic energy absorption and event warning are distinct evidence and are not interchangeable.','線彈性應力由 100 增為 110 MPa、模數仍為 50 GPa，能量密度由 100 增為 121 kJ/m3；可釋放比例未知，不能全部當成拋石動能。~At a fixed 50 GPa modulus, stress rising from 100 to 110 MPa increases elastic energy density from 100 to 121 kJ/m3; an unknown releasable fraction prevents treating all of it as ejection energy.',r'''
彈性能與釋放比例~Elastic energy and releasable fraction§高應力岩體儲存彈性能，開挖造成應力重分配後可能釋放其中一部分。線彈性能密度只是儲存量的理想估計，還需區分裂縫生成、摩擦、波動和拋出物能量；把全部體積乘能量密度直接當支護需求會忽略真正耦合路徑。~Stressed rock stores elastic energy, part of which may be released after excavation redistributes stress. Elastic density estimates storage rather than its partition into fracture, friction, waves and ejection. Multiplying volume by density does not establish support demand without the coupling pathway and releasable fraction.§u=sigma^2/(2E)=(100 MPa)^2/(2*50000 MPa)=0.10 MPa=100 kJ/m3§對照應力估計、岩體剛度及事件後破裂與拋出證據~Compare stress estimates and rock stiffness with post-event fracture and ejection evidence§把儲存能全部或完全不計入支護需求，都可能誤判作用~Equating stored energy to demand, or ignoring it entirely, misrepresents the action§所有岩體彈性能最後都會成為拋石動能~All elastic energy in the rock ultimately becomes ejected-rock kinetic energy
拋出物動能與速度~Ejected-rock energy and velocity§拋出物的動能與速度平方成正比，重量估計和速度估計的誤差有不同影響。表面落塊不一定由同一動態機制造成，需區分重力落下與應力驅動拋出；單塊估算也不能代表整個事件作用在支護的時間和空間分布。~Ejection energy varies with velocity squared, making mass and velocity uncertainty affect it differently. Surface falls need not share the same dynamic mechanism; distinguish gravity fall from stress-driven ejection. A single-block estimate does not establish the event's spatial or temporal loading of support.§Ek=0.5*m*v^2=0.5*100 kg*(5 m/s)^2=1250 J=1.25 kJ§用可取得的影像、塊體質量及落點證據約束速度範圍~Constrain velocity using available images, block mass and landing evidence§僅憑落塊尺寸推估動態需求而漏掉速度平方效應~Demand inferred only from block size misses the squared effect of velocity§拋出塊體質量相同就代表衝擊能量相同~Equal ejected-block mass means equal impact energy in every event
讓壓行程與吸能積分~Yielding stroke and energy integration§讓壓構件透過受控變形吸收功，能量是力對實際行程的積分。高峰值力不一定有足夠行程，低剛度也不等於穩定吸能；必須看完整載入曲線及卸載後損傷，並區分元件試驗邊界與安裝系統邊界。~Yielding components absorb work through controlled displacement, integrating force over actual stroke. A high peak may lack travel, and low stiffness does not establish stable absorption. Review the full loading curve and damage while distinguishing component-test restraint from the installed support system.§W=Fmean*stroke=150 kN*0.20 m=30 kJ§以校正荷重與相對位移積分，檢查行程末端反力變化~Integrate calibrated force against relative displacement and inspect end-of-stroke response§構件行程用盡後突然變硬，將高反力傳到連接與岩體~A component hardens abruptly when stroke is exhausted and overloads connections and rock§元件峰值拉力大就保證它吸收的能量也大~A large peak tensile force guarantees large absorbed energy
岩栓板網與共同變形~Bolt-plate-mesh deformation compatibility§吸能岩栓需要托盤與表面網把岩塊作用傳給它，任一連接先失效都會中斷路徑。各元件可能有不同位移和載入速率，不能只把產品額定能量相加；系統驗證必須確認網的變形、板的穿破和岩栓行程能相容。~An energy-absorbing bolt needs plates and mesh to deliver rock actions; premature connection failure interrupts that path. Components undergo different displacements and rates, preventing simple addition of product energy ratings. Verify compatible mesh deformation, plate punching and bolt travel as a system.§displacementMismatch=meshDeflection-boltTravel=0.18 m-0.10 m=0.08 m§同步量測網、托盤及岩栓相對位移和破壞順序~Measure mesh, plate and bolt relative movements and failure order simultaneously§托盤先穿破網面使岩栓未動員，名義吸能能力無法使用~A plate punches through mesh before the bolt engages and its nominal energy capacity is unavailable§把各元件額定能量加總就能得到整套支護容量~Adding every component energy rating gives the installed system capacity
動態載入速率與試驗邊界~Dynamic rate and test boundaries§動態事件的慣性和載入速率與慢速拉拔不同，錨固界面及金屬變形也可能隨速率改變。落錘試驗能量包含設備和試件的共同反應，不能只依落高推定材料實際吸收量；應量測反彈、裝置變形與力位移歷程。~Inertia and loading rate differ from slow pull tests and may change anchorage and metal response. A drop test contains both apparatus and specimen behaviour, so drop height alone does not establish absorbed material energy. Measure rebound, fixture deformation and force-displacement history.§Einput=m*g*h=1000 kg*9.81 m/s2*1 m=9.81 kJ§將輸入能量與反彈、裝置變形及試件積分功作收支~Balance input energy against rebound, fixture deformation and integrated specimen work§把設備吸收的能量算給岩栓，會高估元件動態表現~Energy absorbed by the fixture is credited to the bolt and overstates dynamic performance§落錘位能完全等於被測岩栓吸收的能量~Drop-weight potential energy equals energy absorbed solely by the tested bolt
微震到時與位置不確定度~Microseismic arrivals and location uncertainty§微震定位使用多站到時差與波速模型，單站訊號不能唯一決定位置。岩層非均質、耦合品質和時鐘偏差會移動估計震源；到時殘差小也可能只是錯誤波速模型被擬合，必須用可驗證參考事件檢查定位誤差。~Location uses multistation arrival differences and a velocity model; one station cannot uniquely locate a source. Heterogeneity, coupling and clocks shift estimates. Small residuals may merely fit an incorrect velocity model, requiring reference events with independently constrained positions to assess error.§pathDifference=v*dt=5000 m/s*0.002 s=10 m, not a unique source position§以已知參考位置事件檢查各站時鐘、耦合及定位殘差~Check station clocks, coupling and location residuals against independently known reference events§時間偏差被當成震源移動，使風險區域被錯誤定位~Timing bias appears as source migration and mislocates the area of concern§單支感測器收到訊號就能唯一定位岩爆位置~One sensor receiving a signal uniquely locates a rockburst
串聯力鏈與容量區分~Serial force paths and capacity distinctions§理想同軸串聯元件承受相同靜態拉力，因此最小力容量限制該理想力鏈。動態吸能卻是每一元件力位移積分，不存在一般性的最小能量法則；同一系統可能因連接位移限制而無法動員某元件的試驗吸能。~Ideal collinear serial components carry the same static force, making the smallest force capacity a limit for that ideal chain. Dynamic energy depends on each force-displacement integral, without a general minimum-energy rule. Connection travel may prevent engagement of a component's tested absorption capacity.§staticForceCeiling=min(300,180,250) kN=180 kN; not a dynamic-energy prediction§逐段核對傳力方向、靜態容量及各元件可用位移~Audit force directions, static limits and available displacement for each component§以最小額定能量代替系統動態分析，忽略不同元件行程~Using minimum rated energy as system capacity ignores differing component travel§串聯支護的吸能能力一定等於最小元件額定能量~Serial support energy capacity always equals the smallest component energy rating
事件計數與偵測完整度~Event counts and detection completeness§事件數增加可能反映真實活動，也可能是感測器靈敏度、噪音或網路覆蓋改變。比較前後資料須先固定可偵測尺度與品質篩選，否則更換設備後會產生假趨勢；計數、位置和能量估計應一起判讀，不能由單一門檻自動判定安全。~More detected events may reflect activity or changed sensitivity, noise and coverage. Fix detection completeness and quality filtering before comparison, otherwise equipment changes create artificial trends. Interpret count, location and energy estimates together rather than declaring safety from a single threshold.§observedRate=events/time=24 events/6 h=4 events/h§對照感測器在線率、噪音水準及同尺度事件分布~Compare sensor availability, noise and events within a consistent detectable range§感測器離線造成事件變少，被誤認為岩體活動降低~Offline sensors reduce event counts and falsely suggest quieter rock behaviour§微震事件減少就必定代表施工區更加安全~Fewer microseismic events necessarily mean the work area is safer
監測融合與決策證據~Monitoring integration and decision evidence§聲學訊號、收斂、岩片剝落及應力估計各觀察不同物理量，彼此不一致時需要診斷而非多數決。預警模型的誤報和漏報都與資料族群有關，不能用訓練準確率代替現地驗證；責任人必須知道哪些通道失效或尚未校核。~Acoustic signals, convergence, spalling and stress estimates measure different phenomena; disagreement needs diagnosis rather than majority voting. False alarms and misses depend on the data population, so training accuracy is not field validation. Decision owners need visibility of failed or unverified channels.§falseAlarmFraction=falseAlarms/allAlarms=3/20=15 percent, with separately unknown misses§將警報逐件與觀察結果及資料缺口對照並保留未確認事件~Compare each alert with observations and data gaps while retaining unconfirmed events§只統計已確認警報而忽略漏報，使預警可靠性被高估~Counting confirmed alerts but ignoring misses overstates warning reliability§預警準確率很高就可取代現場工程判斷~High warning accuracy can replace engineering judgement in the field
事件後剩餘行程與復核~Post-event remaining stroke and requalification§事件後外觀完整不代表元件仍保有原容量，讓壓行程、錨固損傷和接頭變形都可能已消耗。只有經校準且仍符合假設的恆力元件，才能用剩餘行程乘力估剩餘功；不能直接從原額定能量扣掉估計事件能量來宣稱剩餘安全。~An intact appearance does not preserve original capacity after stroke consumption, anchor damage or connection deformation. Remaining force times travel applies only to a calibrated constant-force element still meeting its assumptions. Subtracting estimated event energy from an original rating does not establish residual safety.§remainingWork=calibratedForce*remainingStroke=150 kN*0.08 m=12 kJ§檢查讓壓剩餘行程、錨固及接頭損傷並由負責技師重核~Inspect remaining stroke, anchorage and connection damage for engineer-led requalification§元件已耗盡行程卻沿用原額定容量，後續事件突然脆斷~An exhausted component retains its original rating on paper and fails abruptly in the next event§原額定能量減事件能量就能保證剩餘支護能力~Original rated energy minus event energy guarantees remaining support capacity
''')
